-DSSv3.2.1|10.3.5,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.3.6,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.5,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|10.5.2,PCI-DSSv4.0|10.2.2,PCI-DSSv4.0|10.3.2,QCSC-v1|3.2,QCSC-v1|5.2.2,QCSC-v1|6.2,QCSC-v1|8.2.1,QCSC-v1|13.2,Rule-ID|SV-277062r1149405_rule,STIG-ID|APPL-26-001003,SWIFT-CSCv1|6.4,TBA-FIISB|37.4,TBA-FIISB|45.1.1,TBA-FIISB|45.2.3,Vuln-ID|V-277062"
