    <custom_item>
      type        : CMD_EXEC
      description : "1.45 APPL-26-001023"
      info        : "The macOS system must be configured to audit all failed write actions on the system.

GROUP ID: V-277072
RULE ID: SV-277072r1148668

The audit system must be configured to record enforcement actions of access restrictions, including failed file write (-fw) attempts.

